        "I noticed that you rushed",
        "your last two passes."
      ],
      "audioText": "I noticed that you rushed your last two passes.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n9-leading-coaching-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-68.t02",
      "en": "That was terrible, you never listen.",
      "es": "Eso fue pésimo, nunca escuchas.",
      "explanationEs": "Irrespetuosa: ataca a la persona con terrible y never, y no dice qué hacer.",
      "segments": [
        "That was terrible,",
        "you never listen."
      ],
      "audioText": "That was terrible, you never listen.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n9-leading-coaching-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-68.t03",
      "en": "Next time, breathe before you shoot and stay calm.",
      "es": "La próxima vez, respira antes de disparar y mantén la calma.",
      "explanationEs": "Accionable: Next time + imperativo = un paso que se puede dar.",
